 evens my skin tone.” 节奏加快，镜头切换到她摘下面罩后的画面，光线变得明亮温暖，肤色均匀细腻、泛出自然光泽，她轻触脸颊、笑着说：“My skin feels tighter, clearer, and super glowy — I’m obsessed!” 最后镜头定格在她的“前后对比”画面：左边是使用前的暗沉肤质，右边是使用后的光亮紧致效果，画面中央浮现品牌logo与字幕：✨Smooth · Lift · Calm · Brighten✨ YEELANE LED Mask — Your new skincare essential!添加面罩的柔软质感展示"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [481.20294189453125, 1116.91650390625], "shape": 4, "pos": [2019.7763671875, 772.4403686523438], "widgets_values": ["video/ComfyUI", "auto", "auto"], "inputs": [{"name": "video", "link": 5, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "format"}, {"widget": {"name": "codec"}, "name": "codec", "label": "codec", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "codec"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "SaveVideo", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveVideo"}, "order": 4}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-1161.5557846292222, -498.1807159118702], "scale": 0.8769226950000014}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 60, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "Sora2_I2V爆款视频工作流", "bounding": [1276.3223876953125, 427.1672058105469, 1699.4168701171875, 80.01233673095703]}], "links": [[1, 3, 0, 1, 0, "IMAGE"], [2, 4, 0, 1, 4, "FLOAT"], [3, 9, 1, 3, 2, "STRING"], [4, 3, 3, 4, 0, "VHS_VIDEOINFO"], [5, 9, 0, 7, 0, "VIDEO"]